1. `make local-setup`
2. `k apply -f examples/toystore/toystore.yaml`
3. `k apply -f examples/toystore/virtualService.yaml`
4. `k apply -f config/samples/apim_v1alpha1_ratelimitpolicy.yaml`
5. `k annotate virtualservice/toystore kuadrant.io/ratelimitpolicy=toystore`
6. `istioctl dashboard envoy <kuadrant-gateway-pod>.kuadrant-system`

